lines+=section(1,'Exact live preset','The current parent quick start remains **`stabilization-policy` — “AD-AS, Fiscal Policy & Stabilization.”** Its full 14-concept selection is preserved in `live-preset.json`. This audit selects only its five Phillips concepts; no new preset is created. The current library, core, sidecars, graph registrations and review routes were verified against the prior completed audit before authorship.')
