lines+=section(8,'Types and pools','Ordinary banks total 171 records; ordinary checkpoints total 45; Legendary checkpoints 15; repair 15; bridge 16. Four calculation-pool records are routed into their existing ordinary tiers. Repair seeds, integration and challenge pools are empty, a structural boundary rather than a missing-content finding.')
